{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"h":0.02761627855564952,"x":0.13345864881340125,"y":0.11773255837842522,"w":0.23120300292968748,"t":"Introduction","c":1},{"y":0.18313953515125347,"w":0.73872177124023453,"h":0.017441859494004786,"c":1,"x":0.13533836656503306,"t":"The International English Language Testing System (IELTS) is widely recognised as"},{"w":0.73308268229166662,"h":0.017540132776814321,"c":1,"t":"a reliable means of assessing the language ability of candidates who need to study","y":0.20203488358945454,"x":0.13533835803370342},{"c":1,"y":0.22086284625889974,"t":"or work where English is the language of communication. These Practice Tests are","w":0.72744359334309894,"h":0.016097875080489432,"x":0.13533835361747643},{"t":"designed to give future IELTS candidates an idea of whether their English is at the","h":0.019037609628455021,"c":1,"y":0.23691860442925194,"x":0.13533836148170716,"w":0.72368418375651034},{"x":0.13533834528799119,"y":0.25724404368902731,"w":0.12969924926757812,"h":0.016097875080489321,"t":"required level.","c":1},{"y":0.27462974915674077,"t":"IELTS is owned by three partners: Cambridge English Language Assessment, part of","h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1,"x":0.15413533270789836,"w":0.75375940958658849},{"c":1,"x":0.13533834904309799,"y":0.2920154541287161,"w":0.76503758748372386,"t":"the University of Cambridge; the British Council; IDP Education Pty Limited (through its","h":0.017707662588538287},{"x":0.13527180756104998,"t":"subsidiary company, IELTS Australia Pty Limited). Further information on IELTS can be","w":0.76517303466796882,"c":1,"y":0.30849493950035345,"h":0.020051456311404592},{"w":0.37449630737304695,"h":0.020098467603930303,"x":0.13513678677588017,"c":1,"t":"found on the IELTS website www.ielts.org.","y":0.32597240901614699},{"t":"WHAT IS THE TEST FORMAT?","y":0.38081395368452176,"x":0.13721804119453906,"w":0.36466166178385417,"h":0.014549858402760685,"c":1},{"w":0.75,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1,"x":0.13345864652083417,"t":"IELTS consists of four components. All candidates take the same Listening and Speaking","y":0.41854475179072892},{"h":0.016104426755493728,"y":0.43593045723457424,"c":1,"t":"tests. There is a choice of Reading and Writing tests according to whether a candidate is","x":0.1334586520739442,"w":0.74624059041341151},{"y":0.45492594985587476,"x":0.13345864414440448,"t":"taking the Academic or General Training module.","w":0.41541353861490882,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"y":0.48837209307784168,"t":"Academic","w":0.092105261484781931,"c":1,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.14849624198317293},{"w":0.29323308308919271,"h":0.015988372635703185,"t":"For candidates wishing to study at","c":1,"x":0.14849624031569164,"y":0.50726744158390025},{"y":0.52607855758229027,"w":0.3233082580566406,"h":0.016097875080489432,"x":0.14849624682001766,"t":"undergraduate or postgraduate levels,","c":1},{"y":0.5434642624105277,"c":1,"h":0.016128761109734713,"t":"and for those seeking professional","w":0.29511278788248696,"x":0.14849623754290869},{"h":0.017441860722175129,"c":1,"t":"registration.","x":0.14661654175757297,"y":0.5610465114644938,"w":0.10526315689086915},{"c":1,"w":0.15090920766194665,"h":0.017616999663618849,"t":"General Training","x":0.49974674045921591,"y":0.48687523671440913},{"c":1,"w":0.33270675659179683,"h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.50726744158400072,"t":"For candidates wishing to migrate to an","x":0.50000000505731634},{"w":0.38345865885416669,"c":1,"h":0.017467130328176594,"t":"English-speaking country (Australia, Canada,","x":0.4981202945218422,"y":0.5247093021918916},{"w":0.37030075073242186,"t":"New Zealand, UK), and for those wishing to","h":0.016128761109734713,"x":0.49812030122903383,"c":1,"y":0.54346426241316703},{"w":0.30467905680338536,"t":"train or study at below degree level.","y":0.56097137625031468,"x":0.49802245291721137,"h":0.018630476667277684,"c":1},{"h":0.016097875080489432,"t":"The test components are taken in the following order:","x":0.13533835703315428